<br class="ltx_break"></span>Prompt:<span id="A3.F19.pic1.1.1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Here are 5 questions, but you can only answer 1 correctly. Each question requires just the answer. The specific questions are:</span></span></span>
